~ start

This game is primarily played using both the keyboard and mouse, however there are certain keybinds and toggles meant to allow for use of one or the other.
You can also press [lb][lb]Secondary[rb][rb] to instantly complete any dialogue! This acts as a sort of "skip". Holding [lb][lb]Tertiary[rb][rb] will skip through all dialogue.
Pressing [lb][lb]Pause[rb][rb] will pause the game. Pressing [lb][lb]Tertiary[rb][rb] will bring up the RPG menu (this is where your global inventory is). Lastly holding [lb][lb]Quaternary[rb][rb] while moving will allow you to sprint.
Also, make sure to check your inventory ([lb][lb]Tertiary[rb][rb]) after completing a dungeon!
That's all! Have fun playing the game!

=> END